---
title: Fig, Pear and Rocket Salad
author: Jonathan Simmonds
servings: 4
---

Combine @rocket{150%g}, @figs{4-6}(quartered), and @pears{2}(sliced) in a large bowl.

Add @pecans{50%g}(roughly chopped and toasted) and @?avocado{1}(thinly sliced) if desired.

Drizzle with @extra virgin olive oil{2%tbsp} and @sherry vinegar{1-2%tbsp}.

Toss gently to combine all ingredients.
